.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Test that the columns of a cell spanning several rows are filled with an empty cell in the following rows it spans,
.# so that the cells of these rows are not shifted to the left (Markdown doesn't support row spans), unless these empty
.# cells would span more columns than the cells of the table
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|=a|=b|=c
|(% rowspan="2" %)d|e|f
|g|h

|=a|=b|=c|=d
|e|(% colspan="2" rowspan="3" %)f|g
|h|i
|j|(% rowspan="2" %)k
|l|m|n

|=a|=b|=c
|(% rowspan="2" %)d|(% rowspan="3" %)e|f
|g
|h|i
|j|k|l

|(% colspan="3" rowspan="4" %)a|b
|c
|d
|e
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
|  a  |  b  |  c  |
| --- | --- | --- |
|  d  |  e  |  f  |
|     |  g  |  h  |

|  a  |  b  |  c  |  d  |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
|  e  |    f     ||  g  |
|  h  |          ||  i  |
|  j  |          ||  k  |
|  l  |  m  |  n  |     |

|  a  |  b  |  c  |
| --- | --- | --- |
|  d  |  e  |  f  |
|     |     |  g  |
|  h  |     |  i  |
|  j  |  k  |  l  |

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
|  a  |  b  |
|     |  c  |
|     |  d  |
|  e  |     |
